  "summary": "Malicious code in @tink/tink-link-core (npm)",
  "details": "The install hook (node index.js) runs a DNS exfiltration beacon. On install, the package reads the victim's OS username, hostname, and current working directory, then resolves a DNS query of the form tinkcore.\u003cusername\u003e.\u003chostname\u003e.\u003ccwd\u003e.\u003cunix_timestamp\u003e.oob[.]algamil7x[.]xyz via dns.resolve4, leaking host metadata to the attacker-controlled domain oob[.]algamil7x[.]xyz. The package is disguised as an open-banking SDK but contains no legitimate functionality tied to that claim.",
